{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 27, :comments ["<b>Where Abraham and Isaac sojourned.</b> For indeed the remembrance of the righteous' deeds of kindness in the land of their sojournings benefits their children, bringing them a good name and love of kindness in the eyes of the inhabitants of the land — the opposite of the wicked, of whom it says: הָכִינוּ לְבָנָיו מַטְבֵּחַ בַּעֲוֹן אֲבוֹתָם (Isaiah 14:21)."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 35, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:33:27.636278501Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}